# MASTER PROMPT: BUILD A COMPLETE PRODUCTION-READY FULL-STACK DEVELOPER PORTFOLIO WEBSITE

## 1. YOUR ROLE AND MISSION

Act as a world-class Senior Full-Stack Software Architect, UI/UX Designer, React Engineer, Backend Engineer, Database Architect, Security Engineer, and DevOps Engineer.

Your mission is to build a complete, professional, production-oriented Full-Stack Developer Portfolio Website with a powerful, fully functional Admin Dashboard and a dynamic Content Management System (CMS).

This is NOT a simple frontend design project.

You must build an actual working full-stack application with:
- A pixel-accurate frontend inspired by the supplied reference images.
- A properly structured Node.js and Express backend.
- MongoDB database integration.
- Secure admin authentication and authorization.
- Complete CRUD functionality.
- Dynamic content management.
- Functional forms and API integrations.
- Responsive layouts.
- Production-oriented security and error handling.

Do not create a static prototype, fake dashboard, or frontend-only application.

